QuestGuidance.Register("es",428,{
[13665]="700686B1\n1\tClean the first dirty spot\tA young man is cleaning a memorial by himself. Help him. The memorial can be found in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tClean the second dirty spot\tA young man is cleaning a memorial by himself. Help him. The memorial can be found in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n3\tClean the third dirty spot\tA young man is cleaning a memorial by himself. Help him. The memorial can be found in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n4\tTalk to Nadiph by the memorial\tYou have helped a young man clean the memorial. He seems ready to speak to you. Speak to Nadiph in the Upper Ward.\n5\tTalk to the shopkeep in the Grand Market\030Talk to the man running errands\030Talk to the idle guardsman\030Talk to the energetic youth\tNadiph expressed a desire for help in cleaning the memorial. Perhaps you could secure pledges of assistance from people around the plaza. Talk to passersby around the plaza in the Upper Ward.\n6\tLook for Nadiph\tYou were unable to secure regular assistance from anyone nearby, but perhaps it would cheer up Nadiph to know you tried. Return to Nadiph in the Upper Ward.\n",
[13666]="700306A0\n1\tHabla con Edgal\tHytbold se encuentra al noreste de Río Nevado, a lo largo de las colinas de la Muralla del Este. Edgal te espera en Hytbold.\n",
[13667]="7003EE78\n1\tEncuentra Hîgropor\tEl gran huargo Colmillosombrío y su maestro de jauría se encuentran en Hîgropor, oculto en los niveles superiores en la esquina sureste del paso de Nan Wathren. Debes derrotar a los brutales terrores de Hîgropor, y destruir los ídolos que conducen hasta allí.\n2\tDestruye altares corruptos (total: 5)\030Derrota al Maestro de la manada Tarkrîp\030Derrota a Colmillosombrío\tEl gran huargo Colmillosombrío y su maestro de jauría se encuentran en Hîgropor, oculto en los niveles superiores en la esquina sureste del paso de Nan Wathren. Debes derrotar a los brutales terrores de Hîgropor, y destruir los ídolos que conducen hasta allí.\n3\tInforma al Capitán Pasolargo de tu éxito en Nan Wathren\tEl Capitán Pasolargo está en Puente de Caballetes. Debes volver con el Capitán Pasolargo y contarle que has tenido éxito mermando a las tropas que se están preparando para la guerra en Nan Wathren.\n",
[13668]="7000D9E2\n1\tHabla con Atharbain\tImlad Gelair se encuentra al sureste de la Última morada, bajo las Cataratas de Imladris. Se te ha indicado que hables con Atharbain en Imlad Gelair.\n",
[13669]="70040B6B\n1\tTravel into Lamedon and speak to Gladion\tGladion can be found in the village of Dínadab in Lamedon, across Tarlang's Neck. Lady Rosfin has asked you to seek out a man named Gladion. She hopes you can bring aid to the people of Lamedon as well.\n",
[13670]="700270F9\n1\tHabla con uno de los extraños que Anurin mencionó\tLos forasteros de los que Anurin te habló están acampados justo al sur de Lhan Colvarn, al norte de Lhan Rhos. Anurin te ha dicho que hables con los forasteros que han cruzado no hace mucho Lhan Rhos.\n",
[13671]="70062535\n1\tHabla con Talfryn en Lhan Garan\tTalfryn está en Lhan Garan, en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Habla con Talfryn.\n",
[13672]="70026F03\n1\tHabla con Bain en Lhan Rhos\tBain está en Lhan Rhos, al suroeste del campamento de los exploradores. Alun te ha pedido que hables con Bain, pero te ha advertido que la mayoría de los habitantes de este pueblo no confiarán en ti ni hablarán contigo.\n",
[13673]="7002AE71\n1\tRecoge la cesta de hierba de pipa (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)\tLa granja de Longo Madriguerales está en las Tierras de los Tuk, justo al sur de Delagua en la Comarca. Corre a la granja de Longo Madriguerales y regresa con una cesta de hierba de pipa antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva la cesta de hierba de pipa al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
[13674]="70037F7F\n1\tRally Agelman to your side\tRally Agelman to your side by using the horn given to you by Thane Edric. Thane Edric has asked you to bring Agelman to rejoin with his people along the road south to Aldburg.\n2\tArgue with Thane Edric on Agelman's behalf\tAgelman would like to speak with you about what he can offer the defences of Entwade. You have been ordered to bring Agelman south to Aldburg.\n3\tRide along the road south toward Eastfold\tThe road to Aldburg can be reached by taking the southern fork on the road to the west of Entwade. You have readied Agelman for the journey, and should now ride south.\n4\tFollow the road south toward Eastfold\tThe road to Aldburg can be reached by taking the southern fork on the road to the west of Entwade. You have found no sign of the people of Entwade, and should continue riding south.\n5\tFord the river Snowbourn\tThe river Snowbourn can found flowing through southern Kingstead.\n6\tInvestigate the farmhouse along the road\tThe farmhouse can be found directly south of the river Snowbourn near the border of Eastfold and Kingstead.\n7\tTalk to Pendlac\030Talk to Smála\030Talk to Gyrth\tThe three farmhands can be found at Pendlac's Farm in south-eastern Kingstead. Having seen no sign of Léoflad, you should speak to the three farmhands and ask if the people of Entwade have already passed through.\n8\tFind Léoflad and the people of Entwade\tLéoflad and the people of Entwade can be found along the road south into Aldburg. Léoflad and her people passed very recently. You should ride swiftly to reunite Agelman with them.\n9\tAid Agelman in burying the people of Entwade\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn. Agelman has asked you to aid him in recovering Léoflad's body and preparing for his return to Entwade.\n10\tAid Agelman in returning to Entwade\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn. You have aided Agelman as best you could, and he is now ready to set off. You should speak to Agelman before he departs.\n11\tTalk to Agelman at Pendlac's Farm\tAgelman can be found near the horse at Pendlac's Farm. You have aided Agelman in preparing to return to Entwade, and should now speak with him.\n12\tTalk to Agelman in the Mead Hall of Entwade\tAgelman can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade. Agelman prepares to ride back to Thane Edric with Léoflad's body. You should ride to Entwade and meet him in the Mead Hall.\n",
[13675]="700571B8\n1\tTravel to Thokvist in Misthallow\tMisthallow can be found north of the Floodfells. You should travel to Thokvist in the southern end of Misthallow.\n2\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Thokvist\tSkarding Wargsbane can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Skarding.\n3\tGreet Fanglind with a bow\tFanglind can be found at Thokvist. You should greet Fanglind.\n4\tTalk to Fanglind at Thokvist\tFanglind can be found at Thokvist. You should talk to Fanglind.\n",
[13676]="7002AE7A\n1\tRecoge un barril de vino (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)\tLa Granja de Cotonorte está en Avenal, al norte de Tejonera, en el extremo más septentrional de la Comarca, cerca de Evendim. Corre hasta la granja y regresa con un barril de vino antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva el barril de vino al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
[13677]="70040B09\n1\tTravel to Ost Lontir and speak with Gilanor\tOst Lontir is located in Belfalas, in the foothills of Emyn Ernil. You should speak with Ost Lontir's leader, Gilanor.\n",
[13678]="7002ADBE\n1\tRecoge la cesta de huevos (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)\tLa Granja de Arenilla está justo al este de Cavada Pequeña. Corre a la granja de pollos y regresa con una cesta de huevos antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva la cesta de huevos al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
[13679]="70071626\n1\tMeet Mizâdi on the road to Ahâba\tMizâdi is going ahead with Numûru and Sorkamâl. You should meet her outside of Ahâba, north-west of her small camp.\n2\tDefeat the Ordâkhai ambush\tSomeone is chasing the Beltáni shepherds in your direction! You should aid the shepherds.\n3\tFind Unusâli in Ahâba\tThe Beltáni shepherds you rescued asked you to enter Ahâba and speak to their chieftain. You should enter Ahâba and speak to Unusâli.\n",
[13680]="7002D02A\n1\tLlama a la puerta norte de Stangard.\tStangard es la ciudad al sur de Thinglad, en el Prado de Eorl. Debes intentar obtener acceso a la ciudad de Stangard.\n",
[13681]="70058BBD\n1\tCollect the remains of cold-whelplings at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 9)\tCold-whelplings can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. Mézto has asked you to slay cold-whelplings in Bagûd-mekhem and set their remains upon fires tended by the Orcs of Gundabad.\n2\t'Cook' cold-whelpling remains in fire-pits at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 3)\tFire-pits can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. Mézto has asked to slay cold-whelplings in Bagûd-mekhem and set their remains upon fires tended by the Orcs of Gundabad.\n3\tTalk to Mézto at Drenghól\tMézto can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks. You have done as Mézto asked and sown division between the forces at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report your success to Mézto.\n",
[13682]="7004430C\n1\tCollect branches (total: 8)\030Collect deer hides (total: 8)\tBranches and deer can be found in the woods east of Crithost. You should obtain some woods for repairing barricades and deer hides for making slings for the wounded.\n2\tSpeak with Ceveneth\tCeveneth can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Ceveneth.\n",
[13683]="70066168\n1\tTalk to Bruidis in Tadrent\tHaelam has asked you to bring a list of delayed lumber orders to Bruidis. She can be found in Tadrent, south-west from Calembel.\n",
[13684]="7006C578\n1\tCollect a lizard corpse from the quarry west of Jirush\tGalamê explained that Lord Igbâl would like a new jackal pet. He sent you to collect a lizard corpse to feed Zukhâma, draw it into the open, and capture it for Lord Igbâl.\n2\tAfter collecting the lizard corpse, you are prepared to draw the jackal matron, Zukhâma, from her den. Make your way to the jackal den west of Jirush.\t\n3\tInteract with Zukhâma to place a thong about its neck\tZukhâma, the jackal matron, bows her head in defeat. You should take the opportunity to place a thong around the beast and bring her to Galamê at Jirush.\n4\tDeliver Zukhâma to Galamê at Jirush\tReturn to Galamê at Jirush with the captured jackal matron, Zukhâma. He will see you rewarded for acquiring a new guardian for Lord Igbâl.\n",
[13685]="7005A650\n1\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma in The Pit of Stonejaws\tScout-master Ausma can be found at the encampment of Bárgstad in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in The Pit of Stonejaws.\n",
[13686]="70033860\n1\tReúnete con Gandalf en el Poney Pisador en Bree\tGandalf el Gris te ha convocado para que te reúnas con él en el Poney Pisador en Bree para discutir asuntos que le conciernen.\n2\tHabla con Gandalf el Gris en el Poney Pisador en Bree\tGandalf el Gris está en la Posada del Poney Pisador en Bree. Deberías darte prisa en reunirte con Gandalf el Gris.\n",
[13687]="700227F8\n1\tHabla con Saeradan en Echad Saeradan\tSaeradan está en Echad Saeradan, en las Lomas Ventosas, al sur de Echad Dagoras. Braigiar te ha pedido que encuentres a Saeradan y le prestes tu ayuda.\n",
[13688]="70001120\n1\tHabla con Elrohir\tThorenhad es una ruina en lo alto de una colina, al norte de las guaridas de los osos en las Gargantas del Bruinen. Se halla al este del campamento de Barachen y a cierta distancia al oeste de Rivendel. Anhebir te ha enviado a Thorenhad para presentarte ante Elrohir, hijo de Elrond.\n",
[13689]="70008769\n1\tScout out Tírith Rhaw\tTírith Rhaw lays far to the east beyond the Hoardale River. Soldier Nartul directed you to scout out Tírith Rhaw in the Coldfells.\n2\tReturn to Soldier Nartul at Gramsfoot\tSoldier Nartul awaits your return at Gramsfoot. You discovered and scouted the area surrounding Tírith Rhaw.\n",
[13690]="7000876A\n1\tScout out Tol Ascarnen\tTol Ascarnen is on an island in the Hoardale River, east of Gramsfoot. You were ordered to find and scout out Tol Ascarnen.\n2\tReturn to Soldier Nartul at Gramsfoot\tSoldier Nartul awaits your return at Gramsfoot. You discovered and scouted the area around Tol Ascarnen.\n",
[13691]="7005B45A\n1\tTalk to Shúkurz\tNáin has asked you to help him apologize to Shúkurz. Shúkurz is preparing for the upcoming journey in an old home at the base of Buzra-salân, north of Aslíf.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have delivered Náin's apology to Shúkurz.\n",
[13692]="7002A171\n1\tEncuentra a alguien en Fuerte Dreng que te reciba y ayúdale\tPara llegar a Fuerte Dreng, debes viajar al sur atravesando la Arboleda Lóbrega. Se encuentra en el extremo noroeste de las Tierras Brunas, justo al oeste del Valle de los Huesos. Visita Fuerte Dreng durante tu viaje por las Tierras Brunas y ayuda a cualquiera que esté dispuesto a hablar contigo allí.\n2\tEncuentra a alguien que hable contigo en Fuerte Dreng\tPara llegar a Fuerte Dreng, debes viajar al sur atravesando la Arboleda Lóbrega. Se encuentra en el extremo noroeste de las Tierras Brunas, justo al oeste del Valle de los Huesos. Visita Trum Dreng durante tu viaje por las Tierras Brunas.\n",
[13693]="70060D84\n1\tHabla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella\030Habla con Frothard Tuk en Campotieso\tSalga Pastoverde se encuentra en el pueblo de Nobotella en el este de la Comarca Allende. Frothard Tuk se encuentra en la aldea de Campotieso en el centro de la Comarca Allende. Habla con Salga Pastoverde en Nobotella y Frothard Tuk en Campotieso.\n",
[13694]="7006557C\n1\tPick up the crate of chisel tips\tTinído has asked you to bring a crate of chisel tips north to the dwarf-outpost of Zarsatrâd.\n2\tBring the crate to Irzeben\tYou should bring the crate of chisel tips to Irzeben. Irzeben is in northern Lebennin, at Zarsatrâd.\n",
[13695]="70058353\n1\tPlant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân (total: 4)\tAgátur the Boastful has asked you to plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân. You should plant banners along the road leading to Zudramdân.\n2\tJourney to Zudramdân\tZudramdân can be found in Elderslade. You should journey to Zudramdân.\n3\tTalk to Náth at Zudramdân\tZudramdân can be found in Elderslade. You should talk to Náth at Zudramdân.\n4\tDefeat Orkish forces in Elderslade (total: 10)\tOrkish forces can be found in Elderslade. You should assist the dwarves at Zudramdân.\n5\tTalk to Náth at Zudramdân\tZudramdân can be found in Elderslade. You should talk to Náth at Zudramdân.\n",
[13696]="7002AD99\n1\tRecoge la cesta de manzanas (come el pastel para obtener un impulso de energía)\tEl huerto de Manzanal está en Hobbiton, al oeste de la Colina y Bolsón Cerrado. Corre al célebre huerto de manzanas y regresa con una cesta antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\n2\tLleva la cesta de manzanas al Mercado de los Granjeros\tSperling Tuk, el proveedor de la Feria de los Granjeros, se encuentra en Delagua. Regresa a Delagua lo antes posible, y dale bocados al pastel para ayudarte cuando necesites un impulso de energía.\n",
})
